│with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-01         ✘         ││  LazyGithub is a terminal UI for interacting with GitHub. You can get started by selecting   │
│e-with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-02       ✘         ││  one of the repositories listed in the table on the left. Once you have selected a           │
│-with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-28        ✘         ││  repository, any issues, pull requests, and action workflows will be retrieved and           │
│with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-03         ✘         ││  displayed below it.                                                                         │
│ith-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-29          ✘         ││                                                                                              │
│ith-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-04          ✘         ││  Issues, pull requests, and action lists can also be interacted with!                        │
│e-with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-05       ✘         ││                                                                                              │
│e-with-a-deliberately-long-repository-name-06       ✘         ││                                                                                              │
